{"id":"eace5aa7-14ce-4de6-9f4a-bac4fa770767","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243571,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT ml.level_name, COUNT(DISTINCT m.member_id) AS member_count\nFROM user_tags ut\nJOIN user_tag_map utm ON utm.tag_id = ut.tag_id\nJOIN members m ON m.member_id = utm.member_id\nJOIN member_levels ml ON ml.level_id = m.level_id\nWHERE ut.tag_code = 'CHURN_RISK'\nGROUP BY ml.level_name\nORDER BY member_count DESC\nLIMIT 100;","reasoning_content":"我们需要回答SQL。需要理解: 每个会员等级里有多少人打过\"流失风险用户\"标签。涉及 member_levels, members, user_tag_map, user_tags. 标签 CHURN_RISK。问每个会员等级里有多少人。会员等级：level_name likely. 人员去重? user_tag_map PK member_id, tag_id 组合唯一，所以每个会员每标签唯一。按会员等级分组，统计打过该标签的会员数。members.level_id。注意可能一个会员当前等级。需要输出等级名称和人数。是否只包括被标签的会员，按他们的等级分组。COUNT(*) 或 COUNT(DISTINCT member_id) 由于 tag map 唯一，COUNT(DISTINCT m.member_id) 安全。连接 user_tag_map to user_tags where tag_code='CHURN_RISK'，members join member_levels。需要名称为等级名称？问\"每个会员等级\"通常等级名称。SELECT ml.level_name, COUNT(DISTINCT m.member_id) AS member_count FROM user_tags ut JOIN user_tag_map utm ON utm.tag_id=ut.tag_id JOIN members m ON m.member_id=utm.member_id JOIN member_levels ml ON ml.level_id=m.level_id WHERE ut.tag_code='CHURN_RISK' GROUP BY ml.level_name ORDER BY member_count DESC; 是否需要考虑 level 定义 level_name unique? likely. 保持未匹配? 标签会员 level_id 若 null? 会员必须有 level_id? 没有非空说明。为保留标签但仍无等级? 按等级分组，NULL组? \"每个会员等级\" 可能只等级。如果 member level_id NULL, join 丢掉。但 FK 推荐。规则: 未要求名称，用已有标识；但\"每个会员等级\"需要可读等级，用 level_name。 排序按人数降序。 LIMIT? 聚合分组，无單行聚合，需要 LIMIT 硬性规则3 必须LIMIT，除单行无GROUP BY聚合。因此加 LIMIT 也许至多N。没有N，通常 LIMIT 100? 规则默认TopN至多N。非TopN分组问题需要 LIMIT? 硬性必须LIMIT，可 LIMIT 1000。 但最好 LIMIT 100 或 1000? 必须遵守。使用 LIMIT 100。 参考示例没有LIMIT but instructions require. 输出SQL only."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":3570,"completion_tokens":615,"total_tokens":4185,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3328},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":514},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":3328,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":242},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}